OL,3,GNEWSAMore people now eligible for
OL,4,Apublic sector housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe amount people can earn before
OL,7,Fapplying for social housing on the Isle
OL,8,Fof Man has increased.
OL,10,FThe threshold for both single and joint
OL,11,Fapplications has risen to plug the gap
OL,12,Fcreated by rises in the cost of living.
OL,14,FA single person with no children can
OL,15,Fnow earn #35,800 - up by #1,500 - and
OL,16,Fstill apply for public sector housing.
OL,17,FWhile a couple with three children can
OL,18,Fnow earn #63,900 - a rise of #13,400 on
OL,19,Fthe previous limit.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
