OL,3,GNEWSAMore people now eligible for
OL,4,Apublic sector housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the new rules
OL,7,F"better reflect current earnings and
OL,8,Fhousing costs" and would see more
OL,9,Fpeople eligible to qualify for public
OL,10,Fsector housing.
